-- SPE1 with producers which are shut under each of ORAT, WRAT, GRAT,
-- LRAT, RESV, BHP, THP and GRUP, or stopped under ORAT and GRUP, and water
-- injectors which are shut under RATE, BHP and GRUP. The P-* and I-* wells
-- are shut from the start and never open. The F-* and FI-* wells flow for
-- a month and are then shut with WELOPEN. F-OLIM asks for an oil rate it
-- cannot reach, so it flows under its BHP limit before it is shut. S-ORAT
-- and S-GRUP are stopped from the start and never flow. FS-ORAT and
-- FS-GRUP are completed in all three layers, flow for a month and are then
-- stopped with WELOPEN, so that they may crossflow. A restart file is
-- written at every report step, so the case covers the control mode and
-- status written for shut and stopped wells. The schedule sets these
-- statuses:
--   report step 1 (day 1)  : F-*, FI-* and FS-* open, S-* stopped,
--                            all other wells shut
--   report step 2 (day 31) : as step 1
--   report step 3 (day 32) : S-* and FS-* stopped, all other wells shut
--   report step 4 (day 62) : as step 3

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
RUNSPEC
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

TITLE
   SPE1 - SHUT WELLS UNDER EACH CONTROL MODE

DIMENS
   10 10 3 /

EQLDIMS
/

TABDIMS
/

OIL
GAS
WATER
DISGAS

FIELD

START
   1 'JAN' 2015 /

WELLDIMS
-- Max wells, max connections per well, max groups, max wells per group
   25 3 5 25 /

VFPPDIMS
-- Max rates, THPs, WFRs, GFRs, ALQs, tables
   3 3 2 2 1 1 /

UNIFIN
UNIFOUT

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

INIT

DX
   300*1000 /
DY
   300*1000 /
DZ
   100*20 100*30 100*50 /

BOX
   1 10 1 10 1 1 /

TOPS
   100*8325 /

ENDBOX

PORO
   300*0.3 /

PERMX
   100*500 100*50 100*200 /
PERMY
   100*500 100*50 100*200 /
PERMZ
   100*500 100*50 100*200 /

